// Analytics rule: Auto-Block Brute Force
// Source: SecurityEvent (Windows honeypot VM -> Log Analytics -> Microsoft Sentinel)
// Schedule: runs every 5 minutes, looks back over the last 1 hour
// Alert threshold: query returns > 0 results (i.e. any IP above 50 failures)
// Severity: High | MITRE ATT&CK: Credential Access - T1110 (Brute Force)
// Entity mapping: IP -> Address = IpAddress
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4625                      // failed logon
| summarize FailedCount = count() by IpAddress
| where FailedCount > 50
| extend IPCustomEntity = IpAddress
